        "quiz_type": "single_choice",
        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "The area enclosed between the curves \\(y=x^2\\) and \\(y=2x\\) is",
        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "The curves intersect at \\(x=0\\) and \\(x=2\\). Hence, area \\(=\\int_0^2(2x-x^2)\\,dx=\\left[x^2-\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_0^2=\\frac{4}{3}\\) square units.",
